* {{hyphenation|in|cep|tion|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[creation]] or [[beginning]] of something; the [[establishment]].
#: ''From its '''inception''' the agency has been helping people obtain and properly install car seats for children.''

